{"id": "en_lightning_hike_p1", "total": 68.65, "segments": [{"text": "If lightning strikes on a mountain peak, do not seek shelter under a lone tree.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.34}, {"text": "Jake is hiking above the tree line at dusk when dark clouds fill the sky.", "start": 4.08, "end": 7.12}, {"text": "He has less than 5 minutes before a deadly thunderstorm hits his open position.", "start": 8.08, "end": 11.22}, {"text": "A huge lightning bolt flashes nearby with a roaring crash of loud thunder.", "start": 12.1, "end": 15.34}, {"text": "When thunder roars, go indoors because no place outside is ever truly safe.", "start": 15.98, "end": 19.92}, {"text": "Only a sturdy building or a hard-top car offers real protection from lightning strikes.", "start": 20.66, "end": 23.86}, {"text": "One. Get off peaks and high ridges immediately and start heading down right away.", "start": 24.76, "end": 29.14}, {"text": "Jake starts to run away down the steep mountain slope, leaving the high peak.", "start": 30.08, "end": 32.74}, {"text": "Two. Never shelter under a lone tree or stand near dangerous metal fences.", "start": 33.32, "end": 37.24}, {"text": "Jake avoids a single pine tree and keeps moving quickly to lower ground.", "start": 38.18, "end": 41.0}, {"text": "Three. Spread a group out so 1 strike does not hit everyone at once.", "start": 41.78, "end": 45.22}, {"text": "Jake sees a solid rock overhang down the slope and moves toward it quickly.", "start": 46.06, "end": 49.0}, {"text": "He reaches the ledge and moves inside to enter shelter from the storm.", "start": 49.74, "end": 52.46}, {"text": "Jake did everything right to survive the sudden storm on the mountain peak.", "start": 53.38, "end": 55.94}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan, but there was just 1 big problem waiting inside.", "start": 55.94, "end": 60.46}, {"text": "Freezing rainwater floods the shelter while dusk fades into absolute darkness around Jake.", "start": 61.42, "end": 65.5}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0